      "writtenOn": "2023-05-25T14:56:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The skia style is a bit funny when it comes to `this` prefixes: we use them for methods, to differentiate from free functions, but not for field access (presumably the \u0027f\u0027 prefix is sufficient).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 161,
